WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.586
DGAPN makes three contributions.

00:00:03.666 --> 00:00:07.253
First, spatial Graph Attention,

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:10.919
a GNN that self-attends over node and edge
attributes and encodes 3D structure via an inverse distance matrix.

00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:14.585
Second, the Graph Attention Policy Network,

00:00:14.665 --> 00:00:18.251
an attentional policy over a dynamic fragment
action space trained with PPO.

00:00:18.331 --> 00:00:21.918
Third,

00:00:21.998 --> 00:00:25.584
a random-network-distillation curiosity bonus
giving innovation rewards for high-affinity,

00:00:25.664 --> 00:00:29.250
synthesizable molecules.
